      `the natural persons have the legal authority to represent the provider or the deployer, as applicable` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the information includes the names of those natural persons` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the information includes the contact details of those natural persons` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 71(5) the information includes the names and contact details of the natural persons responsible for registering the system` MEANS
    BRANCH
