        IF NOT (`the natural persons are responsible for registering the system` AND `the natural persons have the legal authority to represent the provider or the deployer, as applicable`) THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "natural persons who are responsible for registering the system and have the legal authority to represent the provider or the deployer"
        OTHERWISE JUST (`the information includes the names of those natural persons` AND `the information includes the contact details of those natural persons`)  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "That information shall include the names and contact details of natural persons who are responsible for registering the system and have the legal authority to represent the provider or the deployer, as applicable"

-- src:1112 | 6. The Commission shall be the controller of the EU database. It shall make available to providers, prospective providers and deployers adequate technical and administrative support. The EU database shall comply with the applicable accessibility requirements.
